# Infinite Masonry

> Responsive virtualized masonry that measures variable-height cards and loads more data as the user nears the end.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @beui/infinite-masonry
```

## Dependencies

- `@tanstack/react-virtual`
- `clsx`
- `lucide-react`
- `motion`
- `next`
- `react`
- `tailwind-merge`

## Usage

```tsx
