## API Reference

### InfiniteMasonry

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `items` | `readonly T[]` | — | Yes | — |
| `getItemKey` | `(item: T, index: number) => InfiniteMasonryKey` | — | Yes | — |
| `renderItem` | `(item: T, index: number) => ReactNode` | — | Yes | — |
| `onLoadMore` | `() => void \| Promise<void>` | — | Yes | — |
| `hasMore` | `boolean` | — | Yes | — |
| `loading` | `boolean` | `false` | No | — |
| `error` | `ReactNode` | — | No | — |
| `onRetry` | `(() => void)` | — | No | — |
| `estimateSize` | `((item: T, index: number) => number)` | `() => 240` | No | — |
| `renderLoadingItem` | `((index: number) => ReactNode)` | `(index) => <DefaultLoadingItem index={index} />` | No | — |
| `emptyState` | `ReactNode` | `<DefaultEmptyState />` | No | — |
| `endState` | `ReactNode` | — | No | — |
| `minColumnWidth` | `number` | `208` | No | — |
| `maxColumns` | `number` | `4` | No | — |
| `gap` | `number` | `12` | No | — |
| `overscan` | `number` | `4` | No | — |
| `prefetch` | `number` | `3` | No | — |
| `animateItems` | `boolean` | `true` | No | — |
| `ariaLabel` | `string` | `Infinite masonry feed` | No | — |
| `className` | `string` | — | No | — |
| `contentClassName` | `string` | — | No | — |
| `itemClassName` | `string` | — | No | — |

